# Research Marketing Design System

Used **only** on `app/landing/*` and `components/marketing/*`.

Studio/chat UI under `/ai` keeps `apropos-design-system.mdc` (Poppins, glass panels).

## Tokens

Source: `app/styles/research-tokens.css`

- Canvas `#08090a`, nav `#0f1011`, cards `#161718`
- **One** acid-lime CTA per screen: `#e4f222` (class `research-lime-btn`)
- Inter (`--font-inter`) + JetBrains Mono (`--font-jetbrains-mono`)
- Max width 1200px (`research-container`), 6px buttons, 12px cards

## Components

Reuse from `components/marketing/`:

- `MarketingNav`, `MarketingFooter`
- `PrimaryLimeButton`, `HeroSection`, `FeatureSplit`, `ProductScreenshotCard`, `PricingTable`

## Don'ts

- No Poppins on marketing pages
- No `apropos-input-dark` / chat bubble patterns
- No multi-stop gradient fills (except placeholder shimmer is N/A here)
- Do not import `AIWriterClient` or studio panels into marketing
